{"parentUuid":"354ef5c9-c876-4e36-93bd-05f07fcb68e9","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5070327a1e24b779","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01THe85CPkMPbF2rmqtU2v1w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01H39DzXW8voydqnqufdTPn4","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"grep -n -i \"5-10\\|incumbent\\|early\\|hour\\|speedup\\|faster\" /home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/a9d8ba25a087fb653.output | head -40","description":"Find timing claims in R10"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":192,"cache_read_input_tokens":20216,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":192,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CasSF8J4DVdHV2v7HKeqT","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"6e7b72ba-8220-4974-986f-304090f551f9","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:03:58.129Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"6e7b72ba-8220-4974-986f-304090f551f9","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"a8f1a005-6197-4ac8-b6c3-3f7619cec3c7","agentId":"a5070327a1e24b779","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H39DzXW8voydqnqufdTPn4","type":"tool_result","content":"22:{\"parentUuid\":\"01abe44c-85f6-493a-927f-569987bde48b\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408\",\"agentId\":\"a9d8ba25a087fb653\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01T5SiYZ2VqKAEVqkcyB8Esh\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"Web search results for query: \\\"Arknights Endfield base building common mistakes pitfalls beginners\\\"\\n\\nLinks: [{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Arknights: Endfield Beginner Guide — Day One Checklist, Build Tips, and Common Mistakes | Output Lag\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://outputlag.com/guides/arknights-endfield-beginner-guide-day-one-checklist-build-tips-and-common-mistakes/\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Arknights: Endfield - Base Building & Automation Mechanics - Mobalytics\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"How to Build Your First Base in Arknights: Endfield - Icy Veins\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.icy-veins.com/arknights-endfield/news/how-to-build-your-first-base-in-arknights-endfield/\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Arknights Endfield Base Building Guide | Arknights: Endfield\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://endfield.gg/arknights-endfield-base-building-guide/\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Endfield - A Guide for the Base From Start to Endgame\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://lungmendragons.com/guides/endfield/base-guide\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Arknights Endfield AIC Base-Building Beginner’s Guide – Layouts and Early Upgrades\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://ultimategacha.com/arknights-endfield-aic-base-building-beginners-guide-layouts-early-upgrades/\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AIC Factory and Base Building Guide | Arknights: Endfield\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://game8.co/games/Arknights-Endfield/archives/537154\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Arknights: Endfield Base Building Guide\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.mumuplayer.com/blog/arknights-endfield-base-building-guide.html\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Early Game Factory Layout and Best Items Guide (Valley IV) | Arknights: Endfield｜Game8\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://game8.co/games/Arknights-Endfield/archives/575846\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Arknights Endfield Building Guide (2026) - Complete Base Construction Tips | Arknights Endfield - Database, Tier List & Guides\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.endfield.info/guides/building\\\"}]\\n\\nBased on the search results, here are the common mistakes and pitfalls for beginners in Arknights Endfield base building:\\n\\n## Key Common Mistakes:\\n\\n**Factory Layout & Building:**\\nOverbuilding too early with sprawling belts and too many low-tier machines wastes power and materials; staying compact until Tier II is recommended. Badly placed Relay Towers or pylons lead to \\\"dead\\\" sections where facilities aren't powered.\\n\\n**Resource Production:**\\nProducing everything at once by running every recipe clogs depots; instead pick a few priority products like construction materials and basic gear resources.\\n\\n**Neglecting AIC Upgrades:**\\nLeaving Resourcing and Processing upgrades low makes later gear and material bottlenecks much worse.\\n\\n**General Approach Mistakes:**\\nTreating factory automation as \\\"nice to have\\\" rather than foundational is a common mistake. Hoarding sanity \\\"just in case\\\" is problematic since there's no reason to save it—spending it daily prevents efficiency loss.\\n\\n## What Beginners Should Do Instead:\\n\\nBeginners should focus on a compact loop around the PAC, basic mining→smelting→crafting chains, and early AIC Plan upgrades in Resourcing, Logistics, Processing, and Power. Start small with basic setups in tiers I and II without stressing optimization; as you unlock more areas, you'll naturally expand your base and figure out what works best.\\n\\n\\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.\"}]},\"uuid\":\"e1ccc41c-8116-4eda-910c-c2bafedd34c6\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-07T22:10:56.062Z\",\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"01abe44c-85f6-493a-927f-569987bde48b\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\\\\.upstream_clones\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}\n40:{\"parentUuid\":\"665abd44-ff15-43ec-a7b1-c6da1554386c\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a9d8ba25a087fb653\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-7\",\"id\":\"msg_01LQKFrJSvaySZVw8DeL36Ry\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"信息已经够充分了，整理输出。\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 终末地玩家社区高级布局技巧调研\\n\\n## 1. 知名 blueprint 设计哲学：现地加工 vs 总线集中\\n\\n玩家共识强烈反对传统 Factorio 风格的\\\"原料总线 → 二级总线 → 成品\\\"大工厂思路。终末地的设计鼓励**现地加工**：总线只输出原材料，每个据点内一路加工到成品。底层原因是**总线出口槽位是稀缺资源，基地面积是充裕资源**——这跟 Factorio 完全相反。这意味着玩家级 blueprint 倾向\\\"高密度纵深块\\\"而非\\\"长条总线\\\"。\\n\\n代表作品：核心武陵电池 `EF018OIei6iI915aUI73`、低容武陵电池（B站魔法Zc目录、梦轩dada）、四号谷地三测日入400万布局。武陵 blueprint 共识配置是 2 满速天有洪炉 + 2 满速息壤电池 + 1 满速武陵药剂，电池设备**自带发电**所以不外置发电机。\\n\\n## 2. 玩家共识的\\\"必避坑\\\"\\n\\n- **物流桥延迟**：经过 2 个物流桥每 4 个产物会卡 1 格延迟（疑似 2 是阈值，更多桥不再叠加）\\n- **协议储存箱共用爆仓**：易爆仓产物（零件）和重要产物（装备元件）共用一个箱子会反向卡产线\\n- **过度计划早期**：低级装备产线没用，只保留当前最高级一条\\n- **总线尾端废弃**：拐角附近的总线槽位最难利用——共识做法是**优先消耗末端**\\n- **死区供电**：动力杆/中继塔 80m 范围放歪导致一片设施静默\\n\\n## 3. 端口/布线/动力杆高频模式\\n\\n- **协议储存箱替代输入总线**：节省总线槽位，无线传输让布局自由\\n- **紧贴粉碎输出口放电杆**：极限利用研磨-精炼-粉碎集群的边角空缺\\n- **断电协议储存箱当隔离仓**：故意不接电用作物理隔离\\n- **设施背向输出**：旋转设施让输出口朝后，能挤出更紧凑布局\\n- **协议储存箱卡精炼-封装之间**：消除浪费空间的标准模式\\n\\n## 4. 知名博主\\n\\n- **魔法Zc目录**（B站）— 一键基建蓝图毕业系列\\n- **梦轩dada**（B站）— 前/中/后期开荒 + 毕业全流程\\n- **帝江号**（B站）— 一图流基建排班表\\n- 工具站：EndfieldTools.dev、Talos Pioneers、enka.network/endfield/aic、EnKAD\\n\\n## 5. 跟我们 70x70 + 326 设施的对应\\n\\n我们的 326 mandatory + max_lex(area, min_side) 实际上**已经在求\\\"最大紧凑现地加工块\\\"**——跟玩家直觉一致。两个具体启发：\\n1. 玩家的\\\"高密度纵深\\\"偏好对应 `min_side >= 6` 的方形偏置——这不只是数学，是游戏机制天然惩罚长条\\n2. 玩家的\\\"协议储存箱替代输入总线\\\"对应我们的 binding_subproblem——port binding 灵活度本来就是游戏机制层面被鼓励的\\n\\n## 6. canonical_rules 没编码但玩家共识必然成立的\\n\\n- **物流桥跳数 ≤ 2 是隐性最优**：超过 2 桥延迟 = 实际有效吞吐下降，但 routing_subproblem 只看连通不看跳数\\n- **拐角槽位的\\\"末端衰减\\\"**：边角虽然几何可达但实际利用率低（玩家会先填中央）\\n- **同盒共用产物的反向阻塞**：binding 时把\\\"高产 + 低需\\\"产物绑同一 storage box 在游戏里会卡，但 flow_subproblem 不一定捕获这种动态阻塞\\n- **设施旋转方向的非对称偏好**：紧贴墙角时背向输出比正向更优——这是 routing 阶段的对称性破缺信号\\n\\n## 可转 hint / nogood 的（3 条）\\n\\n1. **`bridge_hop_le_2` ordering hint**：在 routing_subproblem 给\\\"端口对最大物流桥跳数 ≤ 2\\\"的 routing 方案高 hint 优先级。**不变成硬约束**（游戏里 3+ 桥不是非法，只是次优），但作为 CP-SAT search hint 能加速命中玩家级最优解所在的子空间\\n\\n2. **`storage_box_overload_separation` nogood**：binding 阶段，如果同一 storage box 同时绑定了\\\"高产出 + 低需求\\\"和\\\"低产出 + 高需求\\\"两类产物——这种组合在玩家共识里会卡产线，可以作为 soft nogood / 后置 tiebreak 排除掉等价解中的劣化变体（不影响 area/min_side 主目标）\\n\\n3. **`compact_block_aspect_prior` ordering**：outer_search 候选枚举顺序里，把\\\"接近正方形 + 内部高密度\\\"的候选优先于\\\"长条 + 稀疏\\\"——AI sidecar 的 order_only 范畴，跟玩家\\\"现地加工块\\\"直觉一致，能让早期 wave 更快撞到高质量 incumbent，加速 Benders 收敛而不影响 exactness。\\n\\n---\\n\\n来源：\\n- [游民星空 - 工业开荒规划与产线布局](https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2080424.shtml)\\n- [MuMu - 三测日入400万布局](https://mumu.163.com/news/20251221/41823_1277720.html)\\n- [GameKee - 蓝图分享合集](https://www.gamekee.com/zmd/691229.html)\\n- [B站 魔法Zc目录 - 一键基建毕业蓝图](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s76FBGEow/)\\n- [B站 - 1.0武陵毕业基建](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1c7zYBtEfX/)\\n- [B站 - 仓储与超库存传输小技巧](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qCzaBDEbt/)\\n- [TapTap - 协议储存箱改变基建玩法](https://www.taptap.cn/moment/767449858490500885)\\n- [游民星空 - 自动生产线搭建原理](https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2079616.shtml)\\n- [Output Lag - Beginner Guide & Common Mistakes](https://outputlag.com/guides/arknights-endfield-beginner-guide-day-one-checklist-build-tips-and-common-mistakes/)\\n- [Icy Veins - Best AIC Factory Blueprints](https://www.icy-veins.com/arknights-endfield/news/best-aic-factory-blueprints-for-arknights-endfield/)\\n- [EndfieldTools.dev - Community Factories](https://endfieldtools.dev/community-factories/)\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":1,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2364,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":33549,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":2364,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"}},\"requestId\":\"req_011CaoyWu6MFAVtNQjRZFoM9\",\"attributionAgent\":\"general-purpose\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"d4952b90-2744-46f9-8985-e0257b71a2fe\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-07T22:12:24.565Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\\\\.upstream_clones\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"945055d4-6fe4-462f-b1ba-3c630445b8eb","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:03:58.155Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6e7b72ba-8220-4974-986f-304090f551f9","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
