{"parentUuid":"65a9bc7c-d247-4c25-a988-74854203551e","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5070327a1e24b779","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_011Wuiz7dpxvQVvMPB6cRDsE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ERgyLYfiZrWcSCT7dmdoVY","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"grep -rn \"_candidate_sort_key\" /home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/search/outer_search.py | head -3 && sed -n '225,260p' /home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/search/outer_search.py","description":"Read sort key"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1623,"cache_read_input_tokens":34088,"output_tokens":368,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1623},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":368,"cache_read_input_tokens":34088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1623,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1623,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CasSHisjWPYyPwL5kyf2y","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"fdc09fab-f156-4605-a79c-6424d5db0de7","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:04:32.572Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"fdc09fab-f156-4605-a79c-6424d5db0de7","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"a8f1a005-6197-4ac8-b6c3-3f7619cec3c7","agentId":"a5070327a1e24b779","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ERgyLYfiZrWcSCT7dmdoVY","type":"tool_result","content":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/search/outer_search.py:220:    candidates.sort(key=_candidate_sort_key)\n/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/search/outer_search.py:229:def _candidate_sort_key(candidate: Tuple[int, int, int]) -> Tuple[int, int, int, int]:\n/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/search/outer_search.py:298:    ranked = sorted(non_frontier, key=_candidate_sort_key)\n    area, ghost_w, ghost_h = candidate\n    return (int(area), int(min(int(ghost_w), int(ghost_h))))\n\n\ndef _candidate_sort_key(candidate: Tuple[int, int, int]) -> Tuple[int, int, int, int]:\n    area, ghost_w, ghost_h = candidate\n    min_side = min(int(ghost_w), int(ghost_h))\n    max_side = max(int(ghost_w), int(ghost_h))\n    # Exact objective source-of-truth is max_lex(area, min_side).\n    # Longer-side ordering below is stability-only for deterministic runs.\n    return (-int(area), -int(min_side), -int(max_side), -int(int(ghost_w)))\n\n\ndef _candidate_key(candidate: Tuple[int, int, int]) -> str:\n    return f\"{int(candidate[1])}x{int(candidate[2])}\"\n\n\ndef _candidate_dict(candidate: Tuple[int, int, int]) -> Dict[str, int]:\n    area, ghost_w, ghost_h = candidate\n    return {\n        \"area\": int(area),\n        \"w\": int(ghost_w),\n        \"h\": int(ghost_h),\n        \"key\": _candidate_key(candidate),\n    }\n\n\ndef _is_objectively_worse_or_equal(\n    candidate: Tuple[int, int, int],\n    best_candidate: Tuple[int, int, int],\n) -> bool:\n    return _candidate_objective(candidate) <= _candidate_objective(best_candidate)\n\n\ndef _find_candidate_by_key(\n    candidates: Sequence[Tuple[int, int, int]],","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bc5b099e-1f33-4f71-8659-16231d710696","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:04:32.611Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fdc09fab-f156-4605-a79c-6424d5db0de7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"bc5b099e-1f33-4f71-8659-16231d710696","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a5070327a1e24b779","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_015SCGYc2akgVdzbNqhVppZv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed: `_candidate_sort_key` already does `-area, -min_side` so any aspect prior is degenerate. The artifacts files contain backup snapshots, not A/B data. I have everything needed for the audit.\n\n---\n\n## 1. R10 transcript 里 3 个 hints 定义\n\nR10 (`a9d8ba25a087fb653.output`, 玩家社区调研) 末尾\"可转 hint/nogood 的（3 条）\"：\n\n- **Hint A `bridge_hop_le_2`** (soft hint): routing 中\"端口对最大物流桥跳数 ≤ 2\"高优先级。**不变硬约束**（>2 不非法只是次优）。出处：玩家共识\"经过 2 个物流桥每 4 个产物卡 1 格延迟\"——B 站魔法 Zc 目录、梦轩 dada、TapTap \"协议储存箱改变基建玩法\"。\n- **Hint B `storage_box_overload_separation`** (soft nogood): binding 阶段，禁止同一 storage box 同时绑\"高产+低需\"和\"低产+高需\"两类产物。出处：玩家共识\"易爆仓产物和重要产物共箱反向卡产线\"。\n- **Hint C `compact_block_aspect_prior`** (ordering): outer_search 候选顺序里\"接近正方形+内部高密度\"优先于\"长条+稀疏\"。AI sidecar order_only 范畴。出处：玩家\"现地加工块\"vs Factorio\"长条总线\"哲学。\n\n## 2. 已落地映射\n\n- commit `b2a811b` (hint 1 `bridge_hop_le_2`, `routing_subproblem.py:850-853` `_add_bridge_count_hint` AddHint(var, 0)) ⟷ **R10 Hint A** ✓\n- commit `94351d5` + 三阶段配套 (hint 2 overload separation + caller fallback ladder, env-gated `EXACT_BINDING_USE_OVERLOAD_SEPARATION`) ⟷ **R10 Hint B** ✓\n- 没落地 ⟷ **R10 Hint C** (compact_block_aspect_prior)\n\n**关键发现**：b2a811b commit message 自己交代了 Hint C 的判决——\n> \"P1 #9 hint 3 (compact_aspect) was found NO-OP after manual code read of `_candidate_sort_key` — original key already prefers min_side large (= square) via -min_side, and the proposed aspect_penalty patch reduces to a function already determined by (area, min_side). Skipped (14th save).\"\n\n即`outer_search.py:229-235` 的 sort key 已经是 `(-area, -min_side, -max_side, -ghost_w)`——area 同分时 min_side 大者优先 = 方形优先。Hint C 的 aspect_penalty 落到 (area, min_side) 平面上是 sort key 已蕴含的子函数，新增是 NO-OP。\n\n## 3. 数字 \"+5-10h faster\" 评估\n\nR10 transcript 里**没有数字依据**——是 agent 整理 1-3 条可转 hint 时的定性陈述（\"加速 Benders 收敛\"/\"早期 wave 更快撞到高质量 incumbent\"），无玩家实测、无 solver benchmark。\"+5-10h\" 是路线图编辑阶段拍的估值，非来自 R10。168h 长跑 early-incumbent 时刻在已有 telemetry 里没有 hint on/off 对比锚定。\n\n## 4. 剩余 hint 3 工作量 + 风险\n\n**不需要做。** Hint C 在 `_candidate_sort_key` 当前形式下数学上等价 NO-OP（Pareto 前沿 (area, min_side) 已蕴含方形偏好）。要让它\"真做事\"必须改 sort key 的 strict ordering 引入跟 (area, min_side) 正交的内部密度信号——但 70×70 ghost rectangle 候选只有 (w, h) 两参数，没有\"内部密度\"这维度。soft hint 路线本来 0 风险，但效果同样为 0。\n\n## 5. 已落地 hint 实测 effect\n\n无定量 A/B。`.artifacts/phase3b_*` 下找到的是 telemetry backup 快照不是 hint on/off 对照实验。两个 commit message 都只 claim 单元测试通过（routing+master+exact_contract 321、binding 13、full pytest 2044），无 wall-clock incumbent 时刻对比。Hint B 默认 env-unset（生产关闭），实际运行还在 shadow 状态。\n\n## verdict\n\n**PARTIALLY_REFUTED — 路线图 P1 #9 应标 \"2/3 done, 第 3 个 NO-OP 已撤销\"，并把 \"+5-10h faster\" claim 降级为未实测的定性预期。**\n\n理由：\n1. 3 个 hint 中 Hint A、B 已按 R10 内容正确落地（Hint B 还配 stage 3 fallback ladder 防 spurious INFEASIBLE，工作量超原估）。\n2. Hint C 在 b2a811b commit 已被开发者自己审查为 NO-OP 跳过——路线图未更新就显得\"还差一项\"。**第 3 个 hint 不值得做**（数学等价已实现）。\n3. \"+5-10h faster\" 无证据基础。要么补 30 min 微实验（同一 4×4 wave 跑 hint on vs off 对比 first-incumbent 时刻），要么把数字改为定性 \"predicted modest early-incumbent speedup, unmeasured\"。\n4. 后续动作：（a）路线图 P1 #9 状态改 \"DONE (2 landed, 3rd refuted as NO-OP)\"；（b）开 hint B env 前先做小 wave A/B 验证 Hint A 实际效果，再决定 Hint B 是否值得开。\n\n相关文件：\n- `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/a9d8ba25a087fb653.output` (R10 来源)\n- `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/models/routing_subproblem.py:847-870` (Hint A 实现)\n- `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/models/binding_subproblem.py:215-260` (Hint B 实现)\n- `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/search/benders_loop.py:4007-4011, 4400+` (Hint B fallback ladder)\n- `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/search/outer_search.py:229-235` (Hint C 已被 sort key 蕴含)\n- `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/phase3c_optimization_roadmap_v1.md:63` (待修订路线图行)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1909,"cache_read_input_tokens":35711,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1909,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CasSJAve8vrcpNAs4gtuy","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"4c4f3f21-cdbb-438d-8799-5c64c4fdd773","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:05:22.510Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
